56
00:03:59,436 --> 00:04:00,437
Lalu?

57
00:04:04,741 --> 00:04:05,742
Lalu apa?

58
00:04:06,810 --> 00:04:09,513
Kamu melakukan ini karena mau aku yang minta putus, 'kan?

59
00:04:10,547 --> 00:04:12,883
Kamu saja yang bilang kita putus.

60
00:04:18,789 --> 00:04:19,856
Kenapa?

61
00:04:20,424 --> 00:04:21,725
Kamu tidak berani mengatakannya?

62
00:04:24,594 --> 00:04:25,595
Sial.

63
00:04:31,835 --> 00:04:33,103
Dasar orang bodoh menyedihkan.

64
00:05:18,782 --> 00:05:20,550
Bangun, ayo kita pergi.

65
00:05:39,336 --> 00:05:40,404
Apa kamu tahu?

66
00:05:41,705 --> 00:05:43,573
Jun Kyung selalu berbohong.

67
00:05:45,542 --> 00:05:47,711
Meskipun dia sebenarnya sangat rapuh,

68
00:05:48,812 --> 00:05:51,415
